OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAI had to crawl on my hands and
OL,4,Aknees to get off train, says disabled
OL,5,Awoman
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer family spoke to the assistance desk
OL,8,Fand were taken to the only designated
OL,9,Fwheelchair space on the train. Phoebe
OL,10,Fsaid she was assured a ramp and
OL,11,Fassistance would be waiting, but was
OL,12,Ftold she was in a carriage beyond the
OL,13,Fplatform and could not get off.
OL,15,FGWR said it was "really sorry" and
OL,16,Fadmitted "we let her down, both when we
OL,17,Fhelped her board and at several points
OL,18,Fduring her journey".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
